@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
actor "Customer" as C
participant "BookingControllerImpl" as Ctrl
participant "BookingServiceImpl" as Srv
participant "BookingDaoImpl" as Dao
participant "MysqlConnector" as DB
C -> Ctrl: createBooking(customerId, roomId, dates)
Ctrl -> Srv: validateAndCreateBooking()
Srv -> Dao: insertBooking(Booking)
Dao -> DB: execute SQL INSERT
DB --> Dao: success
Dao --> Srv: booking created
Srv --> Ctrl: confirmation object
Ctrl --> C: Booking confirmation
@enduml